NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT licence covers the CODE and DOCUMENTATION in this repository only.

It does NOT cover:

1. The legal corpus. It is not redistributed here. It is rebuilt from
   data/sources.json by scripts/phase1_build_corpus.py, and each source
   carries its own terms — see the Provenance section of README.md. All
   English legal text from those sources is unofficial translation with no
   legal force; the Korean original governs.

2. The base model. aisingapore/gemma2-9b-cpt-sea-lionv3-instruct is subject to
   AI Singapore's licence and, being Gemma-derived, to Google's Gemma Terms of
   Use. Any fine-tuned adapter derived from it inherits those terms.

The Burmese question/answer pairs in data/samples/ and data/train/ are the
author's own work, written and verified against the cited legal sources, and
are released under this licence together with the code.
